    "title": "Johnson City Schools hosting back to school community day - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WCYB ,\n8 hours ago JOHNSON CITY, Tenn. (WCYB) — Johnson City Schools will be hosting a free back to school community day at Science Hill High School in the coming weeks. Families are preparing for the start of the school year and can come by the school to receive free school supplies, backpacks, and free haircuts. Read full article\n1",
